## All specs by area

Generated by `scripts/gen-docs-index.sh` — do not hand-edit. Covers
every spec directly in `docs/specs/`, which the curated sections
above deliberately do not. Each spec is listed once, under the area its
`**Area:**` line names, newest first. The Status column is its
`**Status:**` word; read it before trusting the spec. A spec's
`**Supersedes:**` and `**Superseded-by:**` lines show here as links in both
directions (`docs/specs/README.md`).

`archive/` is excluded on purpose — it means "not worth reading unless you
are doing history". Everything else is here; the completeness
assertion in the generator fails the build rather than emit a
partial list.

### unsorted

No `**Area:**` line yet (or one that is not a short plain name), newest
first. Not a backlog to bulk-stamp — an area guessed from a title is worse
than none. Add the line when you touch one and know which area it belongs to.

